    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >English</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of a tank that can switch between three distinct forms, each with unique strengths and weaknesses. Use the environment and randomly spawned items to outsmart enemies, avoid detection, and find the exit to clear each level.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between forms strategically to adapt to different situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step in each level offers new challenges and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat means starting over from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover random power-ups scattered throughout the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable enemies that keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >English</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of a tank that can switch between three distinct forms, each with unique strengths and weaknesses. Use the environment and randomly spawned items to outsmart enemies, avoid detection, and find the exit to clear each level.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between forms strategically to adapt to different situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step in each level offers new challenges and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat means starting over from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover random power-ups scattered throughout the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable enemies that keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Danger lurks at every step. Take control of a tri-form tank in a pixel battlefield\u2014push rocks, dodge foes, or trigger traps and ambushes. Every move brings risk or reward. Move, shoot, or act with caution. Tense and fast-paced\u2014defeat means restart. Only those who plan survive and escape.",
